  "description": "Hyeon Seo-Un, who is bullied every day at school, feels a strange gaze on his way home from school. And the next day, a group of people who were tormenting him were found dead...\n\nI thought I could live a normal school life now, but this was not the end. The identity of the strange gaze that gradually hangs over me... someone keeps watching me! \n\nAn extraordinary mystery thriller for mediocrity. \n\n(Source: Naver, translated and edited)",
